"""Monochrome ambient eyes and local telemetry on the native tablet framebuffer.

Run under tablet-pwrkey (which owns wake, idle timing, and input dismissal).
  tablet-sentinel --seconds 240
  tablet-sentinel --render /path/preview.png --rotation 1  # no display writes
Raw pixels follow fbcon rotation; GPS coordinates are never retained or displayed.
Requires Debian python3-pil and fonts-dejavu-core, already installed on this tablet.
"""
